  "note": "The GBIF Backbone (2023-08-28) lists D. suweonensis as a synonym of D. immaculatus. The usage comes from its constituent Catalogue of Life, which the Backbone metadata name without a version. The only Catalogue of Life release of 2023 issued before that Backbone is the Annual Checklist 2023 (ChecklistBank dataset 9910, issued 2023-06-27, DOI 10.48580/dfsr; col_2023.release), in which the name is a synonym of D. immaculatus in the sector whose source is ITIS (ChecklistBank dataset 2144). The ITIS record read here is the current one (valid, citing Amphibian Species of the World v6 and 6.2); which reference ITIS cited for the synonymy in 2023 is not recoverable. A synonymy of the two names had been proposed by Dufresnes et al. 2016 (BMC Evol Biol 16:253); we do not know that ITIS followed it. constituent_doi_current_registry is the DOI of the Catalogue of Life version the GBIF registry shows at the time of the query, not of the version the 2023 Backbone used. The current ITIS usage and the latest Catalogue of Life release are recorded in col_latest and itis.",
